cyberspace-py
=============

This repository contains an independent implementation of the Cyberspace v2
protocol.  It was written from the specification text and contains no code
copied from any other implementation.

The specification, `CYBERSPACE_V2.md`, and the accompanying reference
material are the work of arkin0x and are published under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International licence:

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode

The source code in this repository is under the MIT licence; see LICENSE.

The following data files are taken from the specification repository and
remain under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
licence mentioned above:

    src/cyberspace/data/grandfathered-v1-hyperjumps.txt
    src/cyberspace/data/grandfathered-v2-sidesteps.txt
    tests/fixtures/chain-rules-2026-09-28-virtual-brackets.json
    tests/fixtures/visualization_vectors.json

The chain-rules and visualization vector files are the specification's own
conformance vectors.  They are reproduced here unchanged so that the test
suite runs without a checkout of the specification repository.
